#
# The 0.08889% assurance fee on a sale, in Sutra (fairground_rules.h FR1,
# pay_assure.h F1): floor(amount * 8889 / 10000000), amount in integer
# minor units. amount fits 9(15), so a larger or a negative one is a size
# error: refused, never cut short. fee.tb says the same in Trebago, which
# answers up to 2^53 - 1 (ZXV_AMOUNT_MAX): past 15 digits it is held.
record fairground-fee
  amount: 9(15)
  fee: 9(12)
procedure
  compute fee = amount * 8889 / 10000000
  answer fee
